  "description": "A leafy plant shop built with Pursae Web Builder: a split header with the language switcher and a hover mini-cart, an editorial hero, category tiles, featured and new plants, a care-focused product page with tabs and related plants, and a calm two-column checkout. Every part is a Theme Builder template you can edit visually. Fraunces and Albert Sans, self-hosted. Ships a complete store demo: houseplants in three sizes, planters, care tools and a gift box.",
